+def invalidate_managed_api_key_credentials(provider_ids: Iterable[str]) -> str:
+    """Refresh a running daemon after a native API-key lifecycle mutation.
+
+    iron-proxy reads real upstream credentials once, into the child process
+    environment.  Reloading YAML cannot rotate those values.  Derive affected
+    env slots from the provider catalog, restart only when a live mapping uses
+    one of them, and leave the daemon stopped when removal makes a configured
+    mapping incomplete.  A failed restart is surfaced to the caller so the
+    enclosing credential transaction can roll back while the old K1-bearing
+    daemon remains safely stopped.
